paragraph=f'''9 November stronger lighting references: [the native Neon circle](../reports/studio-neon-circle-20261109/README.md) uses six coloured moving subject copies and a neutral lead, post-isolation rim light, fading floor reflections, native vector floor ellipse and subtle authored atmosphere. Optional ordinary-media Rim light & floor reflection now serializes through the project/compiler, applies after the actual track matte in browser/CPU, and defaults to omission/identity for old projects. Reflection is a vertical mirror about a chosen fixed stage floor line, not inferred geometry or physical relighting. Forty focused frontend and25 worker tests pass; the optional full Studio batch was stopped after more than600s without a terminal result and is not a pass. Actual browser/CPU reflection/glow fixture geometry agrees but low-alpha pixels differ (recorded diagnostic maxima); no strict parity pass is claimed. Normal frontend scene/control Apply/Undo/Redo, Save/independent reopen, complete live/finished timeline recordings and exact compiler/request/worker/download binding pass. The movie is8s/192frames/24fps/576×1024 with{v['layers']}layers/{v['motionKeys']}keys, original source6–14s/song/speed and separately prepared local RVM foreground/matte. No automatic product isolation or autonomous Director is implied. Numeric audio correlation{v['audio']['waveformCorrelation']:.6f}, zero lag and true peak{v['audio']['truePeakDbtp']}dBTP do not qualify human listening. Live capture is{capture['Complete live Studio playback']['observedCaptureFramesPerSecond']:.2f}fps; full predictive picture/audio/edge parity and realtime smoothness remain open. Eight anonymous welcome comparisons, normally signed-in help and58 emitted-asset hashes pass. A local emulator/observer loss before dispatch required exact restoration of the latest33-operation Auth/Firestore/Storage snapshot and three authenticated-generation source objects; prior balance7/zero held was preserved, then one normal symbolic2-credit render settles. Rules protocol line-framing was corrected only in the owned emulator process; identical Rules hash, stored objects and anonymous403 remain verified. No real account or policy permissions changed. Earlier films/projects and the preceding37-file delivery remain exact. Formal17 FUNCTIONAL/9 PARTIAL/1 BROKEN/2 UNIMPLEMENTED/0 PRO/0 PRODUCTION, strict typography13/16 and shared S02/S04/S03 remain unchanged. No paid/provider/GPU execution, production operation, publication, scheduling, push, merge or deployment. Owner creative/listening approval is pending.'''
